# Auth & routes (ubuteco-react)

UX guards only — see [auth-and-roles.md](../../docs/context/auth-and-roles.md) and API [roles-and-access.md](../../../ubuteco_api/docs/context/roles-and-access.md).

## Rules

- Add or change route restrictions in `auth-roles.ts` + `AuthGuard.tsx` + nav config together.
- Update `auth-roles.test.ts` for new helpers.
- Never send `organization_id` in API bodies — tenant from JWT.
- Super admin: read catalog, no operational mutations (`canMutateOperationalData`).
- Kitchen staff: only `/kitchen` and `/settings`.

## Pitfalls

See [common-ai-pitfalls.md](../../docs/context/common-ai-pitfalls.md).
